msgstr "Acorchis"

#. Tag: para
#: fundamentals.docbook:143
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Many of the shortcuts are configurable by way of the <link linkend=\"settings"
"\">Settings</link> menu. By default &katepart; honors the following "
"shortcuts:"
msgstr ""

